<font color="#FFFFFF">You can't live on
minimum wage.</font>

403
00:19:17,643 --> 00:19:20,144
<font color="#FFFFFF">I did things out there!</font>

404
00:19:20,185 --> 00:19:22,144
<font color="#FFFFFF">I did things
with my hands and my mouth</font>

405
00:19:22,185 --> 00:19:25,310
<font color="#FFFFFF">that I'm not proud of
just to get by!</font>

406
00:19:25,351 --> 00:19:27,019
<font color="#FFFFFF">It-It's what you do!</font>

407
00:19:27,060 --> 00:19:29,768
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's what you got to do!</font>

408
00:19:29,810 --> 00:19:32,518
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad, it's been
less than two days.</font>

409
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:35,351
<font color="#FFFFFF">So, I guess this means
we can stay?</font>

410
00:19:35,393 --> 00:19:37,685
<font color="#FFFFFF">You can stay here
as long as you need.</font>

411
00:19:37,727 --> 00:19:42,768
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm just so happy that you kids
are here, safe with us.</font>

412
00:19:42,810 --> 00:19:45,310
<font color="#FFFFFF">This, this huff has just got me
so emotional.</font>

413
00:19:45,351 --> 00:19:46,351
<font color="#FFFFFF">I love you all so…</font>

414
00:19:47,852 --> 00:19:49,476
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who is this guy?</font>

415
00:19:54,768 --> 00:19:56,144
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's he doing?</font>

416
00:19:56,185 --> 00:19:57,393
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's dying.</font>

417
00:19:57,435 --> 00:19:58,420
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, he's drawing something.</font>

418
00:19:58,435 --> 00:19:59,893
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, he's playing Pictionary!</font>

419
00:19:59,935 --> 00:20:01,852
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ooh, I love Pictionary!</font>

420
00:20:01,893 --> 00:20:04,060
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is it, uh,
is it an angel?</font>

421
00:20:04,102 --> 00:20:05,004
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, tree.
Tree, tree!</font>

422
00:20:05,019 --> 00:20:06,227
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a tree!</font>

423
00:20:06,269 --> 00:20:08,144
<font color="#FFFFFF">Pyramid? Uh,
the Great Pyramid!</font>

424
00:20:08,185 --> 00:20:09,435
<font color="#FFFFFF">Pyramid of Giza!</font>

425
00:20:16,102 --> 00:20:19,935
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>This season, an all-new
hit drama…</i> Shoe Police.</font>

426
00:20:19,977 --> 00:20:22,102
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey, look at this:
no tongue.</font>

427
00:20:22,144 --> 00:20:24,435
<font color="#FFFFFF">Looks like someone
didn't want this shoe to talk.</font>

428
00:20:24,476 --> 00:20:27,852
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>- Elisabeth Shue is
- Detective Lacy Sole.</i></font>

429
00:20:27,893 --> 00:20:29,269
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tell me the truth, Doc.</font>

430
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,685
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is he going to make it?</font>

431
00:20:30,727 --> 00:20:33,393
<font color="#FFFFFF">No, I don't think so.</font>

432
00:20:33,435 --> 00:20:35,102
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>Don't miss the show</i></font>

433
00:20:35,144 --> 00:20:38,019
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>the</i> Santa Fe New Indian Journal
<i>has proclaimed "Confusing.</i></font>

434
00:20:38,060 --> 00:20:39,476
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>"A new low for FOX."</i></font>

435
00:20:39,518 --> 00:20:41,102
<font color="#FFFFFF"><i>And "Embarrassing."</i></font>

436
00:20:41,144 --> 00:20:43,935
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shoe Police. <i>Watch it.</i></font>

437
00:20:45,227 --> 00:20:47,019
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bye! Have a beautiful time.</font>

438
00:20:48,269 --> 00:20:49,269
<font color="#FFFFFF">Captioned by Point.360</font>

